      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T06:10:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you please explain how this works - will it not still enter D0i3 after 10s?\n\nAlso, why not just unselect CONFIG_ISH_PM_D0I3?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 83,
        "startChar": 34,
