      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T07:53:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the explanation. I\u0027m happy with this if you think it\u0027s safer. I have a few more questions though.\n\nSo with ISH in D0i2, the ISH will still wake up every 100ms, but it won\u0027t do a DMA copy and wake the host up? Why does it only do the DMA copy in D0i3? And what is it copying if it has no sensor data?",
      "parentUuid": "5f9275e0_a59fd50a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 83,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 83,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "fe691376e81f1e5819c37e056b774c8f26aad933",
